// A GAP: the unnamed participant a phrase leaves open ("a player attacked" —
// which player is not said). Lean tags `NounPhrase.gap` `internal_expansion`,
// so `declare_semantic_primitives` mints no alias for it; a card that writes a
// gap outright needs one, and `Storm Fleet Spy` does. A phrasing macro that
// spells the gap for its position would be better and is
// `semantics-v2-macro-capture-and-plurality`'s.
(
    name: "gap",
    kinds: [NounPhrase],
    params: {"kind": Kind},
    body: Gap(kind: Param(kind)),
)
